      {
        "id": "E1",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Introducing the Microsoft Copilot harness: Unlocking the potential of truly multi-model agentic work - The Official Microsoft Blog",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/28/introducing-the-microsoft-copilot-harness-unlocking-the-potential-of-truly-multi-model-agentic-work/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T16:51:35.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:42:50.876Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Luckily, the GitHub engineering team built a best-in-class, truly multi-model harness , which we’ve adopted company-wide.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/28/introducing-the-microsoft-copilot-harness-unlocking-the-potential-of-truly-multi-model-agentic-work/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T16:51:35.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:42:50.876Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The Microsoft Copilot harness powers Copilot Code, Copilot Studio, the GitHub Copilot app, the CLI, VS Code, and more.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/28/introducing-the-microsoft-copilot-harness-unlocking-the-potential-of-truly-multi-model-agentic-work/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T16:51:35.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:42:50.876Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "And today, we’re making that harness available through Microsoft Foundry .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/28/introducing-the-microsoft-copilot-harness-unlocking-the-potential-of-truly-multi-model-agentic-work/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T16:51:35.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:42:50.876Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Now, you can build on the same harness Microsoft and GitHub ship in our own products, and you don’t have to maintain it.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/28/introducing-the-microsoft-copilot-harness-unlocking-the-potential-of-truly-multi-model-agentic-work/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T16:51:35.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:42:50.876Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We invest in science and engineering work to continually improve and evolve the harness and ensure high-quality, efficient, and low-cost performance across a range of models and workloads.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/28/introducing-the-microsoft-copilot-harness-unlocking-the-potential-of-truly-multi-model-agentic-work/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T16:51:35.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:42:50.876Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The Copilot harness was built by the same GitHub engineers behind new technologies like our multi-model orchestration .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/28/introducing-the-microsoft-copilot-harness-unlocking-the-potential-of-truly-multi-model-agentic-work/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T16:51:35.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:42:50.876Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The harness is built to perform across model families , with 20+ frontier models plus bring your own key, so you can use the right model for the right job.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/28/introducing-the-microsoft-copilot-harness-unlocking-the-potential-of-truly-multi-model-agentic-work/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T16:51:35.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:42:50.876Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "And because the Copilot harness powers surfaces across Microsoft, it’s battle-tested and proven performant at the scale of millions of users and hundreds of real-world use cases.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/28/introducing-the-microsoft-copilot-harness-unlocking-the-potential-of-truly-multi-model-agentic-work/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T16:51:35.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:42:50.876Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "And because the agents you build in Foundry can run on the same harness we’ve adopted across Microsoft, our continuous harness improvements will benefit your agents, too.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/28/introducing-the-microsoft-copilot-harness-unlocking-the-potential-of-truly-multi-model-agentic-work/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T16:51:35.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:42:50.876Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "With the Copilot harness, Microsoft runs the agent loop and sandbox, with governance and optimization built in from day one.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/28/introducing-the-microsoft-copilot-harness-unlocking-the-potential-of-truly-multi-model-agentic-work/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T16:51:35.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:42:50.876Z"
      },
      {
